Build UI with shadcn `base-nova` on `@base-ui/react`, Tailwind v4, and Lucide icons.

Internal apps use the shared design system. External products keep the design system in their own repo.

In a private repo, UI and motion follow the Emil Kowalski skills in `cortex` `.cursor/skills/`. The variant picker is `ui-variants`.
